          "example": "MathJax - exemplu simplu\n\n▲\nCuprins\nirina.ciocan@gmail.com\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ro\">\n <head>\n   <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n   <title>MathML cu MathJax - exemplu</title>\n   <script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n   <script id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/mathjax/2.7.7/MathJax.js?config=TeX-MML-AM_CHTML\">\n   </script>\n </head>\n <body>\n   <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n     <mrow>\n       <mo>[</mo>\n       <mtable>\n         <mtr>\n             <mtd><msqrt><mi>a</mi></msqrt></mtd>\n             <mtd><mn>7</mn></mtd>\n         </mtr>        \n         <mtr>\n             <mtd><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></mtd>\n             <mtd><mn>3.5</mn></mtd>\n         </mtr>        \n       </mtable>\n       <mo>]</mo>\n     </mrow>\n   </math>\n </body>\n</html>\n\nAfișare:",
