          "intro": "Citește materialul profesoarei de mai jos, apoi urmărește explicațiile practice asociate. Această lecție păstrează contextul complet al sursei, inclusiv variantele vechi și comentariile.",
          "example": "\n**Teacher reference:** `index.html`; `views/pagini/index.ejs`.\n\n**Prerequisites:** [003](#issue-003).\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. Open and read the referenced example and identify the elements, selectors, functions or data used by this task.\n2. Use the teacher's thead/tbody, th/td, br and rowspan structure to show a team-confirmed class schedule. Keep the existing PDF link. Choose merged cells that reflect the real schedule.\n3. Check the acceptance criteria below and record the result in the PR or study notes.\n\n**Acceptance criteria**\n\n- [ ] The table is readable before styling, row spans align correctly, and schedule entries are supplied or verified by the team.\n- [ ] Explain the changed source and complete the practice modification below without simply copying a finished solution.\n\n**Practice modification in the teacher's project:** Change a rowspan and repair the resulting row alignment.\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"issue-007\"></a>\n\n### 007. Add dated class announcements with time elements\n\n**Type:** Website task. **Stage:** HTML.\n\n**Teacher reference:** `index.html`; `views/pagini/index.ejs`.\n\n**Prerequisites:** [003](#issue-003).\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. Open and read the referenced example and identify the elements, selectors, functions or data used by this task.\n2. Adapt the announcements section into class notices. Use time with machine-readable datetime, strong and adjacent span elements as in the example.\n3. Check the acceptance criteria below and record the result in the PR or study notes.\n\n**Acceptance criteria**\n\n- [ ] Dates and notice text come from the team; the markup supports the teacher's later date attribute selectors.\n- [ ] Explain the changed source and complete the practice modification below without simply copying a finished solution.\n\n**Practice modification in the teacher's project:** Change a datetime independently of visible text and explain why both must agree.\n\n---\n",
          "explain": "Exercițiul de aici verifică recunoașterea sintaxei din sursă. Pentru a o folosi, rezolvă și exercițiile practice asociate; simpla copiere a numelui nu înlocuiește scrierea codului.",
