          "intro": "Citește materialul profesoarei de mai jos, apoi urmărește explicațiile practice asociate. Această lecție păstrează contextul complet al sursei, inclusiv variantele vechi și comentariile.",
          "example": "\n**Steps**\n\n1. Open and read the referenced example and identify the elements, selectors, functions or data used by this task.\n2. Adapt the recipe links into team-selected study video links. Use one iframe with a name and multiple anchors whose target matches it; preserve the teacher's mechanism without JavaScript.\n3. Check the acceptance criteria below and record the result in the PR or study notes.\n\n**Acceptance criteria**\n\n- [ ] Each link changes the same embedded player; no extra video page or player is added.\n- [ ] Explain the changed source and complete the practice modification below without simply copying a finished solution.\n\n**Practice modification in the teacher's project:** Change an anchor target and explain why it no longer updates the iframe.\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"issue-014\"></a>\n\n### 014. Extend footer links with address and downloadable content\n\n**Type:** Website task. **Stage:** HTML.\n\n**Teacher reference:** `index.html`; `views/fragmente/footer.ejs`.\n\n**Prerequisites:** [001](#issue-001).\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. Open and read the referenced example and identify the elements, selectors, functions or data used by this task.\n2. Retain our existing community links and copyright. Add a legitimate contact address/mailto or tel link where the team supplies one, and a same-origin download example using our existing schedule or an approved asset. Study the teacher's character entities.\n3. Check the acceptance criteria below and record the result in the PR or study notes.\n\n**Acceptance criteria**\n\n- [ ] The footer uses address appropriately; download has a meaningful filename; no fictitious email or phone is published. Correct tel syntax rather than copying the teacher's bare phone href.\n- [ ] Explain the changed source and complete the practice modification below without simply copying a finished solution.\n\n**Practice modification in the teacher's project:** Change the download filename; explain mailto, tel, download, &lt; and &copy;.\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"issue-015\"></a>\n\n### 015. Complete the favicon family and web manifest\n",
