          "referenceText": "3. Check the acceptance criteria below and record the result in the PR or study notes.\n\n**Acceptance criteria**\n\n- [ ] The CSS rules are explained and exercised without adding a calendar feature to the class website.\n- [ ] Explain the changed source and complete the practice modification below without simply copying a finished solution.\n\n**Practice modification in the teacher's project:** Change the first seven header cells and explain how the n+8 selector changes its targets.\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"issue-084\"></a>\n\n### 084. Compare alternate layouts and the delayed heading animation\n\n**Type:** Study exercise. **Stage:** Study-only source files.\n\n**Teacher reference:** `resurse/lectiile_urmatoare/css/general-v.css`; `resurse/lectiile_urmatoare/css/general1000-v.css`.\n\n**Prerequisites:** [022](#issue-022), [028](#issue-028), [031](#issue-031), [032](#issue-032).\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. Open and read the referenced example and identify the elements, selectors, functions or data used by this task.\n2. Compare the alternate grid maps, spacing variables, Roman row counter, circular back-to-top style and row-reversed iframe layout with active CSS. In a practice copy exercise the heading animation's delay, fill-mode, translateX and opacity.\n3. Check the acceptance criteria below and record the result in the PR or study notes.\n\n**Acceptance criteria**\n\n- [ ] Both variants' unique mechanisms are understood without installing a second homepage or duplicate navigation. Only the practice fixture uses the alternate variant.\n- [ ] Explain the changed source and complete the practice modification below without simply copying a finished solution.\n\n**Practice modification in the teacher's project:** Change animation-delay and fill-mode; predict the heading before and after the animation.\n\n---\n\n<a id=\"issue-085\"></a>\n\n### 085. Study the unused ingredient JSON as grouped and indexed concept data\n\n**Type:** Study exercise. **Stage:** Study-only source files.\n\n**Teacher reference:** `resurse/lectiile_urmatoare/json/ingrediente.json`; `resurse/lectiile_urmatoare/json/anunturi.json`.\n\n**Prerequisites:** [059](#issue-059), [064](#issue-064).",
